erting RSI of 27 suggest continued mild selling pressure intraday."}, "news": {"predicted_close": 244.2, "direction": "up", "confidence": 0.54, "rationale": "AMZN pre-market is already ~$243, lifted by Thursday's broad market rally on Iran peace deal optimism and S&P 500 futures pointing marginally higher; a deeply oversold RSI (27) supports a modest mean-reversion bounce. Upside is capped by lingering rate-hike fears, a soft Nasdaq open, and no AMZN-specific catalyst ahead of July 30 earnings."}}, "rationale": "Macro has the best demonstrated accuracy (lowest MAPE, only hit) and is weighted highest; technical and news share the next-lowest APE. Four of five analysts agree on a modest mean-reversion bounce off a deeply oversold RSI (27) with a flat pre-market, so I lean slightly up. Per the strategy note, I shrink momentum's downside magnitude on this muted-move day, anchoring near the cluster around 243.5 while staying close to the 241.51 prior close.", "quote_source": "alphavantage", "status": "scored", "actual_close": 238.55, "ape": 0.020121567805491437, "pass": false, "directional_hit": false, "baseline_ape": 0.012408300146719679, "beats_baseline": false, "brier": 0.3364, "winning_strategy": "momentum", "scored_at": "2026-06-15T16:29:00.243098+00:00"}
